<title>USA: A.H. Belo Q4 shr $0.77 vs $0.54.</title>
<headline>A.H. Belo Q4 shr $0.77 vs $0.54.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
