<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net for year to date 1996 includes a Q1 gain of $3.9 million, or $0.06 per share, on the sale of Belo's interest in its programming distribution partnership.</p>
<p>Year to date 1995 includes a Q2 gain of $2.4 million on the sale of Belo's investment in Stauffer Communications Inc.</p>
